From e67abdb14aad5d40b1c42108124d7bc01921f67b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 17:47:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: probe Canvas, WebGL, Audio, and WebGPU on
 chrome://aegis

One button reads all four Fingerprint Guard surfaces so a user can
see Aegis-stable WebGL/WebGPU strings when the guard is on.
---
 chrome/browser/resources/aegis/aegis.css  |   4 +
 chrome/browser/resources/aegis/aegis.ts   | 143 +++++++++++++++++++---
 chrome/browser/ui/webui/aegis/aegis_ui.cc |   6 +-
 3 files changed, 136 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

